  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion biodiversity conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective to promote and support the conservation of biodiversity of Belarus and its potential for environmental education and ecotourism. The objective is to be achieved through creation of an interactive guide demonstrating the richness of the unique Dnieper and Sozh Reserve located in the Loyew district. The guide will be promoted through a serious of trainings and promotion events for different target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
